Description: |
  pybuggy pytest-plugins cell: the ApiPlugin (registered as pybuggy-api) with configurable options and the api fixture, the SandboxPlugin (pybuggy-sandbox), and the WebPlugin (pybuggy-web, relocated from the web cell together with its config key set and the document validation) — with the install() entry point that wires the plugins into pytest, presence-gated on their documents. Built on pluginator. Exposes PluginConfigKeys and WebConfigKeys as contract types (the api and web config-key enums) for data-driven consumption by other cells.
